  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001120",
        "SRC-001121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three-story assisted living and memory care facility of 81,633 sq ft with 107 assisted living units, 18 memory care units and 54 parking spaces, replacing an office and residential buildings on four parcels (APNs 529-11-013, -038, -039, -040; 1.31 acres) at 15860-15894 Winchester Boulevard and 17484 Shelburne Way.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002916",
        "SRC-002917"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Town staff recommended denial in the August 4, 2023 report. The Planning Commission approved the project 5-2 on August 9, 2023, adding conditions to reduce building height and require evergreen screening trees on the south property line. The Town Council denied a neighbor's appeal 3-2 on September 19, 2023.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002916",
        "SRC-002921",
        "SRC-002922"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On September 10, 2025 the Planning Commission unanimously approved a one-year time extension; the applicant cited capital markets as the reason. The conditions set expiration at September 10, 2026 unless the approval is vested.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002919",
        "SRC-002920"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The state report shows 113 units; town documents show 125 units (107 assisted living, 18 memory care). An office building approved on the site by the Town Council on October 17, 2017 was not built and its approvals expired.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001121",
        "SRC-002916"
      ]
    }
  ],
